  <acqinfo id="af8780193e663e429894c3383043bbe7">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The McKeever collection was donated to RAC by the JDR 3rd estate as a part of the John D. Rockefeller 3rd papers.</p>  </acqinfo>
